  "description": "Eun-Yu never had any reason to talk to, much less eat with, her manager, Ki-Jo Baek. Understandably, she's caught off guard when she's suddenly invited to lunch by her charismatic boss. And she's even more taken aback when that boss suddenly confesses his feelings for her! Unfortunately for Mr. Baek, this new crush of his is actually employed by his mother and looking to blackmail him!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
